{title: Badan Pe Sitare}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Shankar Jaikishan}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]Badan pe sitaare lapate huye,        O jaane tamanna
kidhar jaa ra [F]hee ho,        Za [Dm]ra paas aa [C]o
toh [F]chain aa jaa [Dm]ye,        Za [Dm]ra paas aa [C]o
toh [F]chain aa jaa [Dm]ye,        Hum [Am]hi jab naa honge
toh [F]aye dilru [C]ba,        Ki [Dm]se dekh [C]kar haaye
[F]sharmaayo [Dm]gee,        Naa [Am]dekhogee phir tum
ka [F]bhee [C]aaina,        [Dm]Humare [C]bina roj [F]ghabrao [Dm]gi
[Am]Hai banane sawarane kaa,        [F]jab hee [C]maza,
[Dm]Koi dekhne [C]waala,        [F]aashiq toh [Dm]ho
[Am]Nahi toh yeh jalwe,        [F]hain bhujhate [C]diye,
[Dm]Koi mitne [C]wala ek [F]aashik to [Dm]ho,        [Am]Mohabbat kee yeh
[F]intaha ho [C]gayee,        [Dm]Ke mastee me [C]tumko
[F]khuda [Dm]keh gaya,        [Am]Jamana yeh insaaf [F]karta [C]raha
[Dm]Bura keh [C]gaya ya [F]bhala [Dm]keh gaya
